  "problem": "${13}^{1}=$",
  "worked_solution": "Here, ${13}^{1}$ is in exponent form. The base is $13$ and the exponent is $1.$ \n\nThis means that $13$ is taken as a factor only once. Therefore,\n\n$$\n{13}^{1}=13.\n$$",
